#: ../../tools/ai/mcp_servers.rst:4
msgid "MCP Servers"
msgstr "Servidores MCP"

#: ../../tools/ai/mcp_servers.rst:6
msgid ""
"MCP (Model Context Protocol) Servers are external tool providers that "
"expose capabilities to AI Agents. When an MCP server is connected, its "
"tools become available for the AI to invoke during conversations — "
"enabling the assistant to interact with external systems, databases, "
"APIs, or custom workflows."
msgstr ""
"Los Servidores MCP (Model Context Protocol) son proveedores de "
"herramientas externos que exponen capacidades a los Agentes de IA. "
"Cuando un servidor MCP está conectado, sus herramientas están "
"disponibles para que la IA las invoque durante las conversaciones — "
"permitiendo al asistente interactuar con sistemas externos, bases de "
"datos, APIs o flujos de trabajo personalizados."

#: ../../tools/ai/mcp_servers.rst:8
msgid ""
"Morpheus includes a **built-in MCP server** that provides tools for "
"managing Morpheus resources (instances, clouds, clusters, networks, "
"etc.). External MCP servers extend this with additional capabilities."
msgstr ""
"Morpheus incluye un **servidor MCP integrado** que proporciona "
"herramientas para gestionar recursos de Morpheus (instancias, nubes, "
"clústeres, redes, etc.). Los servidores MCP externos amplían esto con "
"capacidades adicionales."

#: ../../tools/ai/mcp_servers.rst:10
msgid ""
"Navigate to :menuselection:`Tools --> AI Services --> MCP Servers` to "
"manage connections."
msgstr ""
"Navegue a :menuselection:`Tools --> AI Services --> MCP Servers` para "
"gestionar conexiones."

